# ⚙️ Installation

Create environment:

```bash
conda create -n dekaht python=3.10
conda activate dekaht
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Install GPU-enabled PyTorch according to your CUDA version:

https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/

---

# 🚀 Training Examples

## GELU Variant Training

```bash
cd gelu_variant

python train.py \
  --data /path/to/dataset \
  --model-variant tiny \
  --epochs 300 \
  --batch-size 256 \
  --workers 8 \
  --output-dir outputs/gelu/tiny
```

---

## KANAct Variant Training

```bash
cd KAN_Act_variant

python train.py \
  --data /path/to/dataset \
  --model-variant tiny \
  --epochs 300 \
  --batch-size 256 \
  --workers 8 \
  --output-dir outputs/kanact/tiny
```

---

## Hybrid Variant Training (Example)

```bash
cd hybrid_variants_for_ablation/swmsa_mlp_wmsa_kan_hybrid_DEKAHT

python train_dekaht_hybrid.py \
  --data /path/to/dataset \
  --model-variant tiny \
  --epochs 300 \
  --batch-size 256 \
  --workers 8 \
  --output-dir outputs/hybrid_A/tiny
```

